<title>USA: TCSI CFO Paul Farmer resigns.</title>
<headline>TCSI CFO Paul Farmer resigns.</headline>
<dateline>ALAMEDA, Calif. 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>TCSI Corp Corp said Paul Farmer  resigned as chief financial officer effective July 21, by mutual agreement  of the company and Farmer.</p>
<p>The company is conducting a search for a successor.</p>
</text>
